@startuml review_05_observability_evaluation
!pragma layout smetana
title Observability, Evaluation, and Review Slices

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam ArrowColor #334155

package "Runtime modules emit trace" {
  class IngestionPipeline
  class QueryEngine
  class ResponseBuilder
  class EvalRunner
}

package "Trace ports" {
  interface BaseTracer {
    +start_run(name, run_type, inputs): RunContext
    +start_span(run_id, name, span_type, inputs): SpanContext
    +record_event(run_id, span_id, event_type, payload): void
    +record_artifact(run_id, span_id, artifact_type, content): void
  }

  interface BaseTraceSink {
    +on_run_started(run): void
    +on_run_finished(run): void
    +on_span_started(span): void
    +on_span_finished(span): void
    +on_event(event): void
    +on_artifact(artifact): void
  }

  interface BaseCacheStore {
    +get(namespace, key): JsonDict?
    +set(namespace, key, value, ttl_seconds): void
    +delete(namespace, key): void
  }
}

package "Evaluation ports" {
  interface EvaluationService {
    +run_evaluation(cases, evaluator_names): EvaluationReport
  }

  interface BaseEvaluator {
    +name: str
    +evaluate(case, response, trace): Dict<str,float>
  }

  class CompositeEvaluator
  class RagasEvaluator
  class CustomMetricsEvaluator
}

package "Stores and tools" {
  class SQLiteTraceSink
  class CompositeTraceSink
  class NoopExternalTraceSink
  class SQLiteCacheStore
  class DashboardTraceService
  class TrainingDataExporter
}

IngestionPipeline ..> BaseTracer
QueryEngine ..> BaseTracer
ResponseBuilder ..> BaseTracer
EvalRunner ..> BaseTracer

BaseTracer --> BaseTraceSink
BaseTraceSink <|.. SQLiteTraceSink
BaseTraceSink <|.. CompositeTraceSink
BaseTraceSink <|.. NoopExternalTraceSink
BaseCacheStore <|.. SQLiteCacheStore

DashboardTraceService --> SQLiteTraceSink : reads runs/spans/events
TrainingDataExporter --> SQLiteTraceSink : exports cases

EvaluationService --> EvalRunner
EvalRunner --> BaseEvaluator
BaseEvaluator <|.. CompositeEvaluator
BaseEvaluator <|.. RagasEvaluator
BaseEvaluator <|.. CustomMetricsEvaluator
CompositeEvaluator o-- BaseEvaluator

note right of BaseTracer
Review goal:
Can we explain why a query/ingestion behaved that way?
Trace should expose stage inputs, outputs, latency, provider, fallback.
end note

note bottom of BaseTraceSink
Failure isolation:
Trace/cache/evaluation failures must not break MCP/RAG main flow.
end note

note bottom of BaseEvaluator
Evaluation consumes QueryResponse.
It does not call MCP tools and does not know transport details.
end note
@enduml
